{"3353800":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Golden Swirl","steam_appid":3353800,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5237340],"detailed_description":"<h1>Follow Us<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >x: snakoproduction<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discord: AX8gB63Hub<\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a deckbuilder, but you survive by strategically dodging every attack.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not merely a card game. it is a life-and-death struggle. Golden Swirl breaks the mold, seamlessly fusing the depth of deckbuilding strategy with the adrenaline of action-combat evasion.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculated Strategy  - Construct your unique deck, equip bizarre relics, and carefully plan your route through the abyss. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life-or-Death Execution  -  Move, dodge, and seize the perfect moment to play your cards amidst the clash of steel and magic.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind and reflexes are both essential, a single moment of hesitation, and you will meet your end in the very next room.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/09d580dfc75f8ef65625cdd35de0e977.poster.avif?t=1793006647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/09d580dfc75f8ef65625cdd35de0e977.webm?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/09d580dfc75f8ef65625cdd35de0e977.mp4?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deckbuilding Strategy × Semi-Real-Time Action<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the timing of every card played to reposition and adjust your attack vectors. Break free from the static, turn-based exchanges of traditional card games! <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every deck you build dictates your combat rhythm. Strategy and execution! you cannot survive without both.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Characters × Deep Customization<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release features 4 distinct characters, each with their own unique starting relics and card pools. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into character customization, tailor your build to perfectly match your preferred playstyle.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards × Relics × Runes: A Threefold Synergy<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 relics, 120 cards, and a rich array of card runes allow you to forge unique builds tailored to each character's traits. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover deep synergies between cards, triggering these chained mechanisms will exponentially amplify their effects.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/fa136d21f3e8cbbd781e7374b9efd15f.poster.avif?t=1793006647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/fa136d21f3e8cbbd781e7374b9efd15f.webm?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/fa136d21f3e8cbbd781e7374b9efd15f.mp4?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Greed × Fear<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make ripples through the &quot;Golden Will.&quot; These events dictate your path forward and silently erode your character's state, subtly yet fundamentally twisting your deck's composition. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confronted with choices and trials, the whims of fate are tested directly against the deck in your hands. The successes or failures born of calculated risks are a cruel double-edged sword.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Dungeons × Interactive NPCs<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition generates a unique array of maps, enemies, NPCs, and treasures. Your choices will permanently alter your combat rewards and resource progression. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every soul you encounter is a friend—from maddened merchants to silent swordsmen, over 20 NPCs harbor their own tragic tales, heavily warped by the swirling abyss.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/247078c9dde56b20256168bde325319e.avif?t=1793006647\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras_big\/247078c9dde56b20256168bde325319e.avif?t=1793006647 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Swirl × The Nameless One<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> <\/strong>In the primordial age, the Golden God nurtured all creation, only for the &quot;Great Dreamer&quot; to invade this realm descending through the Star-Slik. Eldritch whispers drove the living into a cannibalistic frenzy. Ultimately, the deities fell, and the Black Moon twisted into a colossal Swirl poised to devour everything. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In their final despair, the survivors united to forge one last glimmer of hope—you, &quot;The Nameless One.&quot; You must step into the treacherous Golden Swirl, sworn to uncover the ultimate truth behind this apocalyptic cataclysm. <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ever-shifting, shattered realm ensures no two journeys are ever alike. You will embark on your crusade from disparate starting area, armed with mysterious boons. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traversing this abyss of madness and whispers is an extreme trial of endurance. At the end of this grueling gauntlet awaits a mysterious and unspeakable culmination<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/2471fe4640f1ea12eb65f38938521aaa.poster.avif?t=1793006647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/2471fe4640f1ea12eb65f38938521aaa.webm?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/2471fe4640f1ea12eb65f38938521aaa.mp4?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a deckbuilder, but you survive by strategically dodging every attack.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not merely a card game. it is a life-and-death struggle. Golden Swirl breaks the mold, seamlessly fusing the depth of deckbuilding strategy with the adrenaline of action-combat evasion.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculated Strategy  - Construct your unique deck, equip bizarre relics, and carefully plan your route through the abyss. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life-or-Death Execution  -  Move, dodge, and seize the perfect moment to play your cards amidst the clash of steel and magic.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind and reflexes are both essential, a single moment of hesitation, and you will meet your end in the very next room.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/09d580dfc75f8ef65625cdd35de0e977.poster.avif?t=1793006647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/09d580dfc75f8ef65625cdd35de0e977.webm?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/09d580dfc75f8ef65625cdd35de0e977.mp4?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deckbuilding Strategy × Semi-Real-Time Action<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the timing of every card played to reposition and adjust your attack vectors. Break free from the static, turn-based exchanges of traditional card games! <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every deck you build dictates your combat rhythm. Strategy and execution! you cannot survive without both.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Characters × Deep Customization<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release features 4 distinct characters, each with their own unique starting relics and card pools. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into character customization, tailor your build to perfectly match your preferred playstyle.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards × Relics × Runes: A Threefold Synergy<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 relics, 120 cards, and a rich array of card runes allow you to forge unique builds tailored to each character's traits. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover deep synergies between cards, triggering these chained mechanisms will exponentially amplify their effects.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/fa136d21f3e8cbbd781e7374b9efd15f.poster.avif?t=1793006647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/fa136d21f3e8cbbd781e7374b9efd15f.webm?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/fa136d21f3e8cbbd781e7374b9efd15f.mp4?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Greed × Fear<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make ripples through the &quot;Golden Will.&quot; These events dictate your path forward and silently erode your character's state, subtly yet fundamentally twisting your deck's composition. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confronted with choices and trials, the whims of fate are tested directly against the deck in your hands. The successes or failures born of calculated risks are a cruel double-edged sword.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Dungeons × Interactive NPCs<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition generates a unique array of maps, enemies, NPCs, and treasures. Your choices will permanently alter your combat rewards and resource progression. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every soul you encounter is a friend—from maddened merchants to silent swordsmen, over 20 NPCs harbor their own tragic tales, heavily warped by the swirling abyss.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/247078c9dde56b20256168bde325319e.avif?t=1793006647\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras_big\/247078c9dde56b20256168bde325319e.avif?t=1793006647 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Swirl × The Nameless One<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> <\/strong>In the primordial age, the Golden God nurtured all creation, only for the &quot;Great Dreamer&quot; to invade this realm descending through the Star-Slik. Eldritch whispers drove the living into a cannibalistic frenzy. Ultimately, the deities fell, and the Black Moon twisted into a colossal Swirl poised to devour everything. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In their final despair, the survivors united to forge one last glimmer of hope—you, &quot;The Nameless One.&quot; You must step into the treacherous Golden Swirl, sworn to uncover the ultimate truth behind this apocalyptic cataclysm. <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ever-shifting, shattered realm ensures no two journeys are ever alike. You will embark on your crusade from disparate starting area, armed with mysterious boons. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traversing this abyss of madness and whispers is an extreme trial of endurance. At the end of this grueling gauntlet awaits a mysterious and unspeakable culmination<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/2471fe4640f1ea12eb65f38938521aaa.poster.avif?t=1793006647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/2471fe4640f1ea12eb65f38938521aaa.webm?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/extras\/2471fe4640f1ea12eb65f38938521aaa.mp4?t=1793006647\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Golden Swirl is a dark fantasy, semi-real-time action deckbuilder. Master tactical movement to dodge fierce attacks while managing your hand. Fully voiced with custom heroes, fine-tune your deck, relics, and runes to repel the Swirl. Can you survive the madness?","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Russian, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/d8c3c5c4e5d7545e1862643acb6c72d0ee2819de\/header.jpg?t=1793006647","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/32e85d307d9a50671d64dd5b9b6248bf6732255a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793006647","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3353800\/32e85d307d9a50671d64dd5b9b6248bf6732255a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793006647","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 9.0c<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 10\/11 (64-bi)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU (e.g., NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Snako Production"],"publishers":["Infini Fun"],"demos":[{"a